 "The upside of that raw data is headroom: about four times the color depth of an 8-bit JPEG, plus recoverable highlight and shadow detail that a camera-processed JPEG would have discarded forever. The downside is compatibility — email it, upload it to most websites, or double-click it on a stock Windows PC, and nothing happens.": "cr2-to-jpg,cr2-to-png,cr2-to-webp",
